"""Page copy for the generated style landing pages.

One entry per id in `FancyText.STYLE_PAGES`. This lives here rather than in
the engine because it is only ever read at build time: shipping thirty-two
intros and ninety-six FAQ answers inside fancytext-core.js would put ten
kilobytes of prose on every page of the site to serve one of them.

Fields:

    tagline         the line under the h1
    intro_heading   the h2 above the prose; every one is different, because a
                    heading templated across thirty-two near-identical pages
                    is the tell that they are near-identical pages
    title           <title>, before the " | fontloom" suffix
    description     meta description
    intro / second  two paragraphs, specific to this style
    faq             (question, answer) pairs, rendered as h3/p and as
                    FAQPage JSON-LD
    aka             the other phrases people search for this style

`tools/build_style_pages.py` fails rather than falling back if a style has no
entry here.
"""

